{"v":4,"catch":"拳擊手是一款易於玩的第一人稱拳擊遊戲。","desc":"拳擊手是一款簡單易玩的街機遊戲，可以上手並玩第一人稱動作快速的拳擊遊戲。\n\n與七名 (Ai) 人工智能對手拳擊手中的一名進行三輪激烈的比賽而不被擊倒。\n\n在配備假人和沙袋的訓練館中提高您的拳擊技巧。\n\n擊敗對手拳擊手，成為終極拳擊傳奇！","publisher":"Sabec","release":"2022-12-01","genres":["格鬥","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 1.4GB / Switch 1.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/991b79692942dc0a9b5d0e6215709e81bdf2dffa931b42db552f4437d326acd8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ff05834b89f147457447d46594d14990063b04c3b8394216a9841c2b9cd4204a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7ab4057ccb3bc2585cfd33ba5882cbe02473f7f90f223bbb6cf996a189a63772.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d4e7799ba25a5da2ee81e54236881de8793be1bb706f425a4cf99fd48e67e42e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0d383f1a307ad9ae693a8b9b1d8b9a285c8821b93e549e217d5307862b6e66de.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ef001a05a000","dlc":[]}